<h2 id="zulip-heading">ASCEND on Zulip</h2>
<p>Zulip organizes conversations into channels and topics, so questions and answers stay easy to find later. Use it in your browser, or install the desktop and mobile apps.</p>
<div class="project-links"><a class="button" href="https://ascendflight.zulipchat.com/">Open ASCEND on Zulip →</a><a class="button outline" href="https://zulip.com/apps/">Get the Zulip apps →</a></div>
<h3>Joining</h3>
<p>Access is by invitation. If you don’t have an invitation yet, contact your ASCEND project lead. Zulip uses its own account, separate from the <a href="/data/team/">member login</a> used for data uploads.</p>
